<title>UK: Fire damages cotton on Philippine ship at Piraeus.</title>
<headline>Fire damages cotton on Philippine ship at Piraeus.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Part of the cargo of cotton on board the Philippine-flag vessel Danyal Express was damaged by fire while the vessel was at Piraeus, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said.</p>
<p>Nearly 12 pct of the cargo was estimated to be seriously damaged.</p>
<p>The 15,700 dwt left Piraeus on February 16 for Cadiz.</p>
